# Ardyn, the Usurper makes a token copy of a Vesuvan Doppelganger card from Bot2's graveyard, "except it's a 5/5 black
# Demon". The token has the Doppelganger's ability, so it may enter as a copy of a creature (CR 707.9a, 614.12): it copies
# Grizzly Bears, a copy effect over Ardyn's that doesn't copy color - so its color is the one the copy beneath gives, black,
# not the card's blue nor the Bears' green (CR 707.9c, 613.2a). The rest is the Bears': a 2/2 Bear, with the upkeep ability.
#
# Turn 1: Black Lotus and every Mox cast Ardyn ({5}{B}{B}{B}). Bot2 draws the Doppelganger on turn 2 and discards it to hand
# size. Turn 3: Grizzly Bears from Mox Emerald and Mox Jet; at the beginning of combat Starscourge exiles the Doppelganger
# and makes the token, which copies the Bears.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Ardyn, the Usurper
Grizzly Bears
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x7
Vesuvan Doppelganger
Swamp x12

